meta {
  name: Complex Query - All Features Combined
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products?search=laptop&category=electronics&price[gte]=500&price[lte]=3000&sort=-price&page=1&limit=5
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  search: laptop
  category: electronics
  price[gte]: 500
  price[lte]: 3000
  sort: -price
  page: 1
  limit: 5
}

docs {
  Complex query combining ALL query engine features!
  
  This request demonstrates:
  ✓ Search: "laptop" in name/description
  ✓ Filter: category = electronics
  ✓ Range Filter: price >= 500 AND price <= 3000
  ✓ Sort: by price descending (high to low)
  ✓ Pagination: page 1, limit 5 items
  
  Query breakdown:
  - search=laptop           → Regex search
  - category=electronics    → Exact match filter
  - price[gte]=500          → Price >= $500
  - price[lte]=3000         → Price <= $3000
  - sort=-price             → Sort by price (high to low)
  - page=1                  → First page
  - limit=5                 → 5 items per page
  
  Result: Find electronics with "laptop" in name/description,
  priced between $500-$3000, sorted by price (highest first),
  showing first 5 results.
  
  Try modifying any of the query parameters!
}
